20","segments":["¶Deceit [is] in the heart of them that imagine evil: but to the counsellors of peace [is] joy."],"ref":"Proverbs 12:20","verse":20,"words":[{"text":"¶Deceit","strong":"H4820"},{"text":" [is] in the heart","strong":"H3820"},{"text":" of them that imagine","strong":"H2790"},{"text":" evil","strong":"H7451"},{"text":": but to the counsellors","strong":"H3289"},{"text":" of peace","strong":"H7965"},{"text":" [is] joy","strong":"H8057"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":16740,"title":"Proverbs 12:21","segments":["¶There shall no evil happen to the just: but the wicked shall be filled with mischief."],"ref":"Proverbs 12:21","verse":21,"words":[{"text":"¶There shall no evil","strong":"H205"},{"text":" happen","strong":"H579"},{"text":" to the just","strong":"H6662"},{"text":": but the wicked","strong":"H7563"},{"text":" shall be filled","strong":"H4390"},{"text":" with mischief","strong":"H7451"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":16741,"title":"Proverbs 12:22","segments":["¶Lying lips [are] abomination to the LORD: but they that deal truly [are] his delight."],"ref":"Proverbs 12:22","verse":22,"words":[{"text":"¶Lying","strong":"H8267"},{"text":" lips","strong":"H8193"},{"text":" [are] abomination","strong":"H8441"},{"text":" to the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":": but they that deal","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" truly","strong":"H530"},{"text":" [are] his delight","strong":"H7522"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":16742,"title":"Proverbs 12:23","segments":["¶A prudent man concealeth knowledge: but the heart of fools proclaimeth foolishness."],"ref":"Proverbs 12:23","verse":23,"words":[{"text":"¶A prudent","strong":"H6175"},{"text":" man","strong":"H120"},{"text":" concealeth","strong":"H3680"},{"text":" knowledge","strong":"H1847"},{"text":": but the heart","strong":"H3820"},{"text":" of fools","strong":"H3684"},{"text":" proclaimeth","strong":"H7121"},{"text":" foolishness","strong":"H200"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":16743,"title":"Proverbs 12:24","segments":["¶The hand of the diligent shall bear